#: src/apps/billing/PricingPage.tsx
msgid "Yes. An organisation owner or admin can cancel or change the plan from Settings, Billing; a member cannot. A cancelled subscription runs to the end of the period already paid for. An upgrade takes effect on the next request. A downgrade never deletes anything: if the organisation holds more conversations than the new plan allows, the existing ones stay readable and exportable and creating new ones waits until you upgrade or remove some."
msgstr "Yes. An organization owner or admin can cancel or change the plan from Settings, Billing; a member cannot. A canceled subscription runs to the end of the period already paid for. An upgrade takes effect on the next request. A downgrade never deletes anything: if the organization holds more conversations than the new plan allows, the existing ones stay readable and exportable and creating new ones waits until you upgrade or remove some."

